{"id":2025,"title":{"romaji":"Nande Koko ni Sensei ga!?","english":"Why the hell are you here, Teacher!?","native":"なんでここに先生が!?"},"slug":"nande_koko_ni_sensei_ga","synopsis":"Kawanuma West may be a public school, but some of its students are about to get private lessons in sex ed courtesy of four very attractive teachers! To be clear, none of our lady educational professionals begin their semesters by writing “get involved with a fortunate male member of my class” in their daily planners…  but strange and inexplicable things keep happening to thrust our teacher/pupil combos into sexually charged situations where something’s bound to happen! Whether it’s falling into water, doors ripping off clothing, or that frequent staple of Japanese school life, the accidental breast/face collision, these poor ladies just can’t help it. And what are the guys supposed to do as they’re pulled deeper and deeper into titillating TILF traps of epic proportions?\n\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)","format":"TV_SHORT","season":"SPRING","year":2019,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:44:19","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 05:46:27","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":38397},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":104325},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":42060},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":14413},{"site":"ANN","externalId":21469},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":11719},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"HIDIVE","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":4041,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/o7kwdXM6yFJfcooqtw9yIJUQHnYMGIVRZPeUq2Xu.jpg"},{"id":4042,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/i2QyaXv6TXzfuwfgBv6WkRWkOgWJaubHl866EmbV.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":180,"name":"Tear Studio","slug":"tear_studio"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":693,"name":"Nande Koko ni Sensei ga!?","slug":"nande_koko_ni_sensei_ga"}]},"animethemes":[{"id":9189,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":9190,"ti